+- *"This is the 1976 infrared-bound theorem."* Yes, re-proved at scope for this rule with explicit constants, and paired with a zero-field Bogoliubov bound that uses the long-range-order parameter directly, which avoids the spontaneous-magnetization limit and its convexity argument.
